  "query": "-- 订单聊天：游标之后的一页，按时间正序（重连补拉、哈希链校验）。$1 order_id, $2 游标（不含）, $3 条数\nSELECT id, order_id, sender_id, kind, body, image, warn, prev_hash, hash, created_at\nFROM order_messages\nWHERE order_id = $1 AND id > $2\nORDER BY id\nLIMIT $3\n",
